âœ” Cantor raises announced thralls after enemy resolution; no hidden immediate attacks (0.447421ms)
âœ” reinforcements respect six slots and cannot carry an unannounced extra enemy (0.422995ms)
âœ” Silence cancels necromancy; canceled attacks do not become armor; guard remains guard (4.157053ms)
âœ” killing the raising source before ending the turn prevents its reinforcements (0.551847ms)
