âœ” boss is forecastable from run seed independently of earlier RNG consumption (1.716315ms)
âœ” elite formations offer four distinct questions and never guarantee all six relics (80.649576ms)
âœ” targeted camp upgrade changes precisely the selected duplicate entry (0.555023ms)
